   "id": "55896",
   "title": "关于腾讯视频 VIP 会员月卡供应安排调整的通知",
   "date": "2026-09-29",
   "page_url": "https://www.10086.cn/aboutus/news/pannounce/fj/index_591_591_detail_55896.html",
   "summary": "尊敬的客户，您好! 因权益合作方单方面调整供货策略，影音会员大流量及PLUS 娱乐版会员权益池内的腾讯视频 VIP 会员月卡供应安排调整如下: 自 2026年10月1日起，该权益改为限量供应，领完即止;自2026 年11月1日起，腾讯视频 ",
   "content": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;尊敬的客户，您好!<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;因权益合作方单方面调整供货策略，影音会员大流量及PLUS 娱乐版会员权益池内的腾讯视频 VIP 会员月卡供应安排调整如下:<br>\n自 2026年10月1日起，该权益改为限量供应，领完即止;自2026 年11月1日起，腾讯视频 VIP 会员月卡将无法领取。<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 如遇无法领取的情况，您可选择权益池内其他权益，具体可领取权益以领取页面实时展示为准。感谢您的理解与支持，我们将持续优化服务体验。</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;福建移动<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;2026年9月29日</p>",
